    "Frontend শুধু": "Frontend only",
    "বা order reference পাঠাবে। Controller নিজের database থেকে": "or send order reference. The controller will pull from its own database",
    "এবং customer/order record নেবে। Browser-এর price, type বা fee trust করবেন না।": "and will take the customer/order record. Do not trust the browser's price, type, or fee",
