    "Official Merchant UUID ও Payment API Key দিয়ে crypto invoice তৈরি করে; আলাদা webhook secret নেই।": "Sèvis munite UUID machann ofisyèl ak kle API peman pou kreye fakti kripto; pa gen okenn sekrè webhook separe.",
    "MecoPay Webhook URL — provider dashboard-এ বসাবেন": "MecoPay Webhook URL — mete nan tabliyotechn yo sou tablo founisè a.",
    "Client এই URL নিজের provider account-এর Webhooks / Callback / Notification settings-এ যোগ করবে। Client-এর নিজের webhook URL এখানে দেওয়ার দরকার নেই; provider event আগে MecoPay-তে আসবে, তারপর MecoPay client website-এ configured merchant webhook পাঠাবে।": "Kliyan an ap mete URL sa a nan kont founisè li a nan Webhooks / Callback / Notification settings. Pa bezwen bay URL webhook pwòp li isit la; evènman founisè a pral vini anvan nan MecoPay, apre sa MecoPay pral voye webhook machann ki konfigire sou sit kliyan MecoPay la.",
    "Provider dashboard-এ payment completed/succeeded এবং refund/failed events enable করুন। Secret/signature verification MecoPay backend-এ হবে।": "Kle tablodbò founisè a pou peman konplete/siksè ak demann ranvwa ki konplete echwe, pèmèt. Verifye sekrè/siyati fèt nan dèyè MecoPay.",
