    "AccessPage Telegram link শনাক্ত করে": "Identifies the AccessPage Telegram link",
    "edge function invoke করার চেষ্টা করে; সফল হলে one-time invite URL নেয়, ব্যর্থ হলে raw link fallback করে। এই function-এর source/secure deployment contract এই repository-তে নেই—তাই production-এ bot approval চালু আছে ধরে নেবেন না। Bot token কখনো browser বা client page-এ রাখবেন না।": "Tries to invoke an edge function; if successful, obtains a one-time invite URL, otherwise falls back to the raw link. The function's source/secure deployment contract is not in this repository—do not assume bot approval is enabled in production. Never store the Bot token in the browser or client page.",
    "Facebook Graph API call কেবল server থেকে হবে। App token, Page/Group permission এবং access token client browser-এ যাবে না। এই repository-তে Facebook Group member-add/approval-এর production Graph API endpoint নেই। Client backend paid invoice যাচাই না করে raw group URL দিয়ে member add/approve করতে পারবে না; server-side access API এবং Meta permission contract আলাদাভাবে তৈরি করতে হবে।": "Facebook Graph API call will only be made from the server. App token, Page/Group permission and access token will not go to the client browser. There is no production Graph API endpoint for Facebook Group member-add/approval in this repository. Client backend paid invoice verification is not performed and raw group URL cannot be used to add/approve a member; server-side access API and Meta permission contract must be created separately.",
    "Drive link-ও webhook-এর পরে paid order-এর সঙ্গে associate করুন। Public link হলে সরাসরি button দেওয়া যায়; private file হলে client backend বা Drive access service থেকে entitlement অনুযায়ী restricted URL দিতে হবে।": "Also associate the Drive link with the paid order after the webhook. If the link is public, you can show the button directly; if it is a private file, provide a restricted URL from the client backend or Drive access service according to the entitlement.",
