    "। Node: Express router। Python: Django URL/view বা Flask route। এটি frontend route নয়।": "Node: Express Router. Python: Django URL/View oder Flask-Route. Das ist keine Frontend-Route.",
    "Secret configure করুন": "Secret konfigurieren",
