    "Controller-এ পাঠানো": "Sent til Controller",
    "হলো delivery metadata। এগুলো নিজে থেকে Telegram bot approval বা Facebook Group membership তৈরি করে না। Payment success-এর পরে client backend নিজের order-এর paid entitlement দেখে button দেখাবে।": "Það er delivery metadata. Þessi gögn framkalla ekki sjálfkrafa Telegram bot samþykki né Facebook hópmeðlimi. Eftir að greiðsla tekst, mun client backend skoða paid entitlement fyrir eigin pöntun og sýna hnapp.",
    "বর্তমান": "Núverandi",
    "AccessPage Telegram link শনাক্ত করে": "AccessPage Telegram-hlekkur greinir",
    "edge function invoke করার চেষ্টা করে; সফল হলে one-time invite URL নেয়, ব্যর্থ হলে raw link fallback করে। এই function-এর source/secure deployment contract এই repository-তে নেই—তাই production-এ bot approval চালু আছে ধরে নেবেন না। Bot token কখনো browser বা client page-এ রাখবেন না।": "Reyni að kalla á edge function; ef það tekst færðu einnota invite URL, ef ekki þá raw link fallback. Uppruni- / öruggur deployment-samningur þessa function er ekki í þessu geymi—ekki gerðu ráð fyrir að bot approval sé virkt í framleiðslu. Bot-tokens skulu aldrei vera í vafra eða klientsíðunni.",
    "Facebook Graph API call কেবল server থেকে হবে। App token, Page/Group permission এবং access token client browser-এ যাবে না। এই repository-তে Facebook Group member-add/approval-এর production Graph API endpoint নেই। Client backend paid invoice যাচাই না করে raw group URL দিয়ে member add/approve করতে পারবে না; server-side access API এবং Meta permission contract আলাদাভাবে তৈরি করতে হবে।": "Facebook Graph API köll munu eingöngu fara fram á þjóninum. App token, Page/Group leyfi og aðgangslykill munu ekki fara í vafrann hjá notanda. Í þessum repository eru engin production Graph API endapunktar fyrir Facebook Group member-add/approval. Client backend getur ekki bætt við meðlim eða samþykkt meðlim án þess að staðfesta paid invoice; server-side access API og Meta permission contract þarf að vera sérstaklega búin til.",
    "Drive link-ও webhook-এর পরে paid order-এর সঙ্গে associate করুন। Public link হলে সরাসরি button দেওয়া যায়; private file হলে client backend বা Drive access service থেকে entitlement অনুযায়ী restricted URL দিতে হবে।": "Eftir webhookinn tengdu Drive linkinn við paid order. Ef Public link er til staðar, má strax sýna button; ef private file er, þarf að veita restricted URL frá client backend eða Drive access service samkvæmt entitlement.",
    "হলো MecoPay server/API থেকে দেওয়া one-time access value। Controller শুধু নিজের trusted order record-এর value API-তে পাঠাবে; client browser-এ code তৈরি বা পরিবর্তন করবে না। Webhook একই field": "Það er one-time aðgangur frá MecoPay server/API. Controller sendir aðeins gildi troðtra pöntunarupplýsingar API-ið; client browser-inn mun ekki búa til eða breyta kóða. Webhook sama field",
    "-এ পাঠাবে।": "-will send to.",
    "Client developer নিজের success page-এর framework অনুযায়ী": "Client þróunaraðili samkvæmt eigin success síðu ramma",
    "implement করবেন। Facebook button click করলে group URL এবং server-provided": "Implementaðu. Þegar Facebook hnappur er smelltur, kemur hópur URL og server-afhent gildi.",
    "নিজের protected backend route-এ পাঠাবেন; code frontend-এ hard-code করবেন না।": "Sendu á þitt verndað bakenda slóð; forritið í frontend skaltu ekki harðkóða.",
    "webhook-এ invoice ও paid status save → নিজের backend-এ": "Webhook -inn geymir reikning og greiðslustöðu í eigin bakenda.",
    "ধরনের protected route → invoice/customer authorization check → server-side Telegram/Facebook/Drive access service call → frontend-এ button/access URL।": "Tegund verndaðrar leiðar → reiknings-/viðskiptavinaheimild athugun → server-side Telegram/Facebook/Drive aðgangsþjónusta köllum → frontend-inn hnappur / aðgangsURL.",
    "Telegram-এর UI hook আছে, কিন্তু তার edge-function source/deployment contract নেই; Facebook Group access endpoint-ও নেই। তাই নির্দিষ্ট production URL বা token ধরে code লিখবেন না। Access API contract তৈরি ও deploy হলে তার exact request/response sample এই guide-এ যোগ করতে হবে।": "Telegram UI hook er til staðar, en edge-function uppruni/deployment samningur vantar; Facebook hóp aðgangur endpoint er einnig ekki til staðar. Þess vegna skaltu ekki semja kóða byggðan á ákveðnu production URL eða tákna. Þegar Access API samningur er búinn og dreift, skaltu bæta nákvæmri beiðni-svörun sýnidæmi við þessa leiðbeiningu.",
    "ধাপ ১: API Endpoint ও Headers": "Skref 1: API-endpoint og kërslur",
    "* কোনো Brand ID আলাদা পাস করার দরকার নেই—API Key থেকেই MecoPay Server Engine সংশ্লিষ্ট ব্র্যান্ড শনাক্ত করে নেবে।": "* Engin Brand ID þarf að senda sérstaklega — API-lykillinn mun bera kennsl á viðkomandi vörumerki í MecoPay Server Engine.",
    "ধাপ ২:": "Skref 2:",
