    "Controller-এ পাঠানো": "Sent to Controller",
    "হলো delivery metadata। এগুলো নিজে থেকে Telegram bot approval বা Facebook Group membership তৈরি করে না। Payment success-এর পরে client backend নিজের order-এর paid entitlement দেখে button দেখাবে।": "Delivery metadata. These do not automatically create Telegram bot approval or Facebook Group membership. After payment succeeds, the client backend will check the paid entitlement of the order and display the button.",
    "বর্তমান": "Currently",
    "AccessPage Telegram link শনাক্ত করে": "AccessPage identifies the Telegram link",
    "edge function invoke করার চেষ্টা করে; সফল হলে one-time invite URL নেয়, ব্যর্থ হলে raw link fallback করে। এই function-এর source/secure deployment contract এই repository-তে নেই—তাই production-এ bot approval চালু আছে ধরে নেবেন না। Bot token কখনো browser বা client page-এ রাখবেন না।": "attempt to invoke the edge function; if successful, takes a one-time invite URL, otherwise falls back to a raw link. The source/secure deployment contract for this function is not in this repository—so do not assume bot approval is enabled in production. Never keep the Bot token in the browser or on the client page.",
    "Facebook Graph API call কেবল server থেকে হবে। App token, Page/Group permission এবং access token client browser-এ যাবে না। এই repository-তে Facebook Group member-add/approval-এর production Graph API endpoint নেই। Client backend paid invoice যাচাই না করে raw group URL দিয়ে member add/approve করতে পারবে না; server-side access API এবং Meta permission contract আলাদাভাবে তৈরি করতে হবে।": "Facebook Graph API call will only be made from the server. App token, Page/Group permission and access token will not go to the client browser. There is no production Graph API endpoint for Facebook Group member-add/approval in this repository. Client backend paid invoice verification is not performed and raw group URL cannot be used to add/approve a member; server-side access API and Meta permission contract must be created separately.",
    "Drive link-ও webhook-এর পরে paid order-এর সঙ্গে associate করুন। Public link হলে সরাসরি button দেওয়া যায়; private file হলে client backend বা Drive access service থেকে entitlement অনুযায়ী restricted URL দিতে হবে।": "also associate the Drive link with the paid order after the webhook. If the link is public, a button can be provided directly; for a private file, the client backend or Drive access service must issue a restricted URL according to entitlement.",
    "হলো MecoPay server/API থেকে দেওয়া one-time access value। Controller শুধু নিজের trusted order record-এর value API-তে পাঠাবে; client browser-এ code তৈরি বা পরিবর্তন করবে না। Webhook একই field": "this is the one-time access value provided by the MecoPay server/API. The Controller will only send the value of its own trusted order record to the API; it will not generate or modify code in the client browser. Webhook uses the same field",
    "-এ পাঠাবে।": "-will send to.",
    "Client developer নিজের success page-এর framework অনুযায়ী": "Client developer according to the framework of their own success page",
    "implement করবেন। Facebook button click করলে group URL এবং server-provided": "implement. When the Facebook button is clicked, the group URL and server-provided",
    "নিজের protected backend route-এ পাঠাবেন; code frontend-এ hard-code করবেন না।": "send to your own protected backend route; do not hard-code the frontend code.",
    "webhook-এ invoice ও paid status save → নিজের backend-এ": "In the webhook, the invoice and paid statuses are saved to your own backend →",
    "ধরনের protected route → invoice/customer authorization check → server-side Telegram/Facebook/Drive access service call → frontend-এ button/access URL।": "Protected route type → invoice/customer authorization check → server-side Telegram/Facebook/Drive access service call → frontend button/access URL",
    "Telegram-এর UI hook আছে, কিন্তু তার edge-function source/deployment contract নেই; Facebook Group access endpoint-ও নেই। তাই নির্দিষ্ট production URL বা token ধরে code লিখবেন না। Access API contract তৈরি ও deploy হলে তার exact request/response sample এই guide-এ যোগ করতে হবে।": "Telegram UI hook exists, but there is no edge-function source/deployment contract; Facebook Group access endpoint does not exist either. Therefore do not rely on a specific production URL or token in code. If an Access API contract is created and deployed, its exact request/response sample should be added to this guide.",
    "ধাপ ১: API Endpoint ও Headers": "Step 1: API Endpoint and Headers",
    "* কোনো Brand ID আলাদা পাস করার দরকার নেই—API Key থেকেই MecoPay Server Engine সংশ্লিষ্ট ব্র্যান্ড শনাক্ত করে নেবে।": "* No separate Brand ID is required—the API Key will identify the brand associated with the MecoPay Server Engine.",
    "ধাপ ২:": "Step 2:",
