    "Official Merchant UUID ও Payment API Key দিয়ে crypto invoice তৈরি করে; আলাদা webhook secret নেই।": "Creates a crypto invoice using official Merchant UUID and Payment API Key; no separate webhook secret.",
    "MecoPay Webhook URL — provider dashboard-এ বসাবেন": "Enter the MecoPay Webhook URL in the provider dashboard.",
